      "title": "WELL's Q3 FFO Beat Estimates on Strong SHO Portfolio Growth",
      "summary": "Welltower Inc. (WELL) delivered robust third-quarter results with normalized FFO of $1.67 per share (up 24.6% YoY) and revenues of $3.72 billion (up 38.4% YoY), beating consensus estimates. The company's seniors housing portfolio showed strong momentum with 21% SSNOI growth and occupancy improving 320 basis points to 90.2%. Management raised 2026 FFO guidance to $6.47-$6.53 per share, driven by strong SHO performance and $4.1 billion in investments completed during the quarter.",
